{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unite the strength of the Vampires and the Werewolves and combine their defences in a unlikely alliance to defend from the humans. Select your moves between playing cards, earning coins or unlocking stronger decks to survive their rampage. Choose your desired rewards and build unique decks to survive their next attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game offers a twist in the deckbuilding experience. In each turn  the player must choose which deck to use rather than what card to play. Choose your rewards carefully balancing the power of each of your decks</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose rewards to strengthen your decks\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between five classes with unique mechanics that lean on specific aspects of the gameplay loop, each with their own cards or skills\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock more skills and further upgrade your defenses with more than 12 skills and upgrades to choose from making each run unique and more compatible with your playstyle</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4088570?t=1761516643","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4088570?t=1761516643","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088570/63f6a8213674cc442da1c4a34449b7d10ad46ceb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761516643","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088570/63f6a8213674cc442da1c4a34449b7d10ad46ceb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761516643","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"des